OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fmostly cloudy through the evening with
OL,7,Ffurther showers. A few more clear
OL,8,Fspells developing overnight for
OL,9,FShetland, but still mostly cloudy with
OL,10,Fshowers.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FVariable cloud and bright
OL,13,Fspells through the day with a
OL,14,Fscattering of showers. Fresh
OL,15,Fnortheasterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
