OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FNortherly winds continuing to push a
OL,7,Fmix of scattered showers and brighter
OL,8,Fspells across the Northern Isles on
OL,9,FThursday and Friday, wintry at times.
OL,10,FBecoming mostly dry on Saturday.
